# OOP AutoGrader (EIU Capstone)

`project_tracker: github`

## What this is

Full-stack auto-grader: students upload Java + MMD; backend compiles and grades via reflection against a PostgreSQL rubric.

## Run

| Command | Effect |
|---|---|
| `npm start` (repo root) | Frontend `:5173` + backend `:8002` |
| `npm run backend` | Spring Boot API |
| `npm run frontend` | Vite dev server |
| `mvn spring-boot:run` | Backend only from `backend/` |

## Stack

- **Backend:** Spring Boot 3.2, Java 17, PostgreSQL, JWT + Google OAuth (`@eiu.edu.vn` only)
- **Frontend:** React 18, Vite 7, Tailwind 3, `react-router-dom`, `@react-oauth/google`

